  states whose candidate set contains a held-out answer : 3507/9893 (35.4%)
  rows in such states                                  : 7385/14923 (49.5%)
  states whose candidates are ENTIRELY held-out answers : 0

  v1 is answer-keyed at the SOURCE only: rollouts start from a train
  answer, but nothing stops a held-out answer from surviving in the
  candidate set, or from being the preferred action (694 rows).

