9. SPLITS
========================================================================
  files in sft_package/data/dpo_midgame: ['train.jsonl']
  meta.split values: {'train': 14923}

  There is no validation file. The DPO notebook loads train.jsonl,
  shuffles it and trains on all of it, computing `acc` per batch on
  the batch it is training on. The reported 0.604 -> 0.836 is a
  TRAINING accuracy; no held-out preference number exists for v1.

